   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Multiply <span data-math=\"\\left( {x - 4} \\right)\\left( {2x - 3} \\right)\">\\left( {x - 4} \\right)\\left( {2x - 3} \\right)</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {x - 4} \\right)\\left( {2x - 3} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Use the distributive property.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x\\left( {2x - 3} \\right) - 4\\left( {2x - 3} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Use the distributive property again.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x\\left( {2x} \\right) - x\\left( 3 \\right) - 4\\left( {2x} \\right) - 4\\left( { - 3} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Simplify.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2{x^2} - 3x - 8x + 12\"></span></p>\n<p>Like terms are constants or have the same variable and exponent. Add the coefficients and keep the same variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2{x^2} - 11x + 12\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"2{x^2} - 11x + 12\">2{x^2} - 11x + 12</span></p>"
    }
   ],
